//   assignment over None) or DISSOLVES it: 'pool.dissolve(p)' reads the record
//   out whole and frees its cell, and field lists take the value apart --
//   'let core, ask = rec.(core, ask)', 'let buf = core.(buf)' -- each piece
//   going where the ending says. A record is dissolved once, at one moment;
//   no piece is taken out of a record that stays alive.
