//   LEAVES the record. When the kernel gives it back it is on the done list
//   again, 'isLate()', and the asker dissolves it, the buffer going home. Its
//   outcome then is what the kernel really did: a receive, read or send that
//   finished after all is Done with its count, the bytes in its buffer (so an
